{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5ab629aa9dc5a833da0b6","chatId":"d1bc091dc9e747fcb9585d6ea907d97a","sessionId":null,"userId":99241,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":9378,"promptTokens":428,"completionTokens":290,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 20:04:50"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068593853688122,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5ab629aa9dc5a833da0b5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794485090825,"createTime":"2026-11-12 20:04:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5ab629aa9dc5a833da0b5","chatId":"d1bc091dc9e747fcb9585d6ea907d97a","sessionId":null,"userId":99241,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小安非常想吃巧克力蛋糕，所以她的好朋友小萨打算给她买一个。小萨把蛋糕放在一个透明的盒子里，可以看到里面的内容。盒子上写着香草蛋糕。小萨把蛋糕给小安时，愁眉苦脸地说他们的巧克力蛋糕卖完了。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小安最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 娱乐\nB) 伤心\nC) 愧疚\nD) 反对\nE) 感激\nF) 惊讶\n\n## 问题 2\n小安为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小萨给她买了她想要的蛋糕\nB) 萨莉没有买她想要的蛋糕\nC) 小安被萨莉的蛋糕盒成功地戏弄了\nD) 她不知道萨莉买给她的是巧克力蛋糕","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":6,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068593853688122,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5ab629aa9dc5a833da0b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794485090822,"createTime":"2026-11-12 20:04:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"41984525f12443c7b7d9ebec09550378"}